  "description": "Prices holding steady, so we act",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to a<strong> 🔒 subscriber-only article🔒 </strong></em>of 2 stock picks. One of these stocks, Affirm, was mentioned in a prior video…but this is exactly why we have the chat. Sometimes, someone mentions a ticker…I go look…and I’m like “ooooooo la la”. We were waiting to make sure there weren’t any significant breaks in price action after <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NVDA&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> price action.  Nvidia spiked, pulled back, and is now hovering. Meanwhile, several other stocks sprinted up, and have been staying up. </p><p>We have talked about Affirm extensively, and have traded it successfully before. One note about Affirm, someone made the comment on people not repaying their loans… this is a non-worry, they recoup their losses by selling the defaulted loans to third party collection agency. They also have FDIC insurance. Lastly, as of July 2025, they reported a 30-day delinquency rate of only 2.4%.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> So to me, its not a huge deal. </p><p><strong>PLEASE NOTE, AFFIRM HAS EARNINGS TODAY, 8/28. Earnings I typically avoid, but need some action. The market has been dull. Proceed at your own risk, you have been warned!</strong></p><p>The other stock is:  👇</p>",
